    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"2\">Level 2 - Beginner</span><span class=\"time\">15 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip ok\">Easy</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Hashing</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Frequency count</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/unique-number-of-occurrences/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 1207</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Unique Number of Occurrences</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Count twice: first value -&gt; occurrences in a hash map, then push every occurrence count into a hash set and fail on the first repeat (or compare the sizes). O(n) time, O(n) space.</p>\n"
